 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p>While many humans vary in shape and size, your human character will have these traits.</p>\n<p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> One ability score of your choice increases by 2 and other ability scores increase by 1. Choosing different Human races replaces this ASI.</p>\n<p><strong>Age.</strong> Humans reach adulthood in their teens and live for around a century.</p>\n<p><strong>Alignment.</strong> There is no clear alignment that is consistent among all humans. Just about any alignment can be justified.</p>\n<p><strong>Size.</strong> Humans in the Jujutsu Kaisen world are typically 5-6 feet tall. Some can rest far outside this range, but your size will count as medium.</p>\n<p><strong>Speed.</strong> Your base walking speed is 30 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Jujutsu Sorcerer</strong></p>\n<p>You are part of a family of sorcerers or have been involved from a young age, you gain the following:</p>\n<p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> One ability score of your choice increases by 2 and another by 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Skills.</strong> You gain proficiency in martial weapons.</p>\n<p><strong>Trained Cursed Energy.</strong> You gain a Cursed Energy feat.  </p>"
  },
